<p id="sVKWLZ2C">
  <t id="hj-Bj6i5">Last month on May 4, I made </t>
  <unknown type="document-mention" id="M4UVN-Tx" data=""/>
  <t id="CyvvI3Dh"> because our design was meh. Two weeks later things had barely moved. The app was taking shape but still looked pretty devy.</t>
</p>
<unknown type="image" id="eoaKcp33" data=""/>
<p id="jUWRSsw4">
  <t id="NPg0xwUu">No group-by. Old task creation modal. Bad.</t>
</p>
<p id="mq4dWfZI">
  <t id="F2CF_Fxn">Our website was a shell. Some nice graphics but no content.</t>
</p>
<p id="Q8HEKS-x">
  <t id="f9ccgxMy">Our startup strategy was in flux: we were still deciding between narrowing on OS for startups and general AI workspace (we chose the latter). That wasn't until May 27th.</t>
</p>
