<h1 id="vRih5n98">
  <t id="tZmMlm1f">Now</t>
</h1>
<p id="jF3LNhFg">
  <t id="o8LosM9N">Now, things are starting to move along nicely. Lots of stars, and our first paying users on our new $40 plan. It's really exciting.</t>
</p>
<unknown type="image" id="qOAp7sTc" data=""/>
<p id="ycbcYyJS">
  <t id="T7mn2m3J">Our docs.macro.com is populated, looks nice on the surface but still needs work.</t>
</p>
<p id="27VDQFN7">
  <t id="LHbN7Jku">Our website is getting there. As of </t>
  <date-mention id="Fb3bmWbs" date="2026-06-16T04:00:00.000Z" displayFormat="june 16"/>
  <t id="9y9qm2Ih"> we have some nice new landers for each feature. Before that we didn't really have anything explaining our features!</t>
</p>
<p id="8ushZRkc">
  <t id="9CrZ_EM5" bold="true">We have a mini brand </t>
  <t id="coyifX5j">thanks to our Insta ads</t>
  <t id="HrOvHmhe" bold="true">! </t>
  <t id="5hZhPL_C">I went to present at South Park Commons earlier this week and they were like "oh you're macro?" Everyone had heard of us.</t>
  <t id="Kz8JEopJ"> That's step 1.</t>
</p>
<p id="tRDJSH3L"/>
<h1 id="MRju-IU2">
  <t id="lqN4HRJz">But...</t>
</h1>
<ul id="UCM-Aw5y">
  <li id="9FVkh68t">
    <t id="MvUTh6N5">Still some issues with onboarding</t>
  </li>
  <li id="5NpIzr4I" value="2">
    <t id="FM6rqrF3">Mobile still heavily in flux, basically Peter is re-doing how it all works</t>
  </li>
  <li id="0-lBjktO" value="3">
    <t id="eiL58aBH">Markdown still deleting docs</t>
  </li>
  <li id="GwrooK_7" value="4">
    <t id="lDjjhEce">We need to make website and docs even better</t>
    <t id="w268PNiB">, super professional, Linear-quality</t>
  </li>
  <li id="iUjUVhm1" value="5">
    <t id="E6vTJEar">We still need to ship PR's, multi-inbox</t>
    <t id="zYQjXMLN">, and CRM</t>
  </li>
</ul>
<p id="JcLnWFij"/>
<h1 id="GVA1jTWg">
  <t id="7qJijAMs">Then...</t>
</h1>
<p id="6mgOOfcn">
  <t id="pc2Jv0dz">Begin ads in full force like last year - sign up 10s of thousands of users... and organic in earnest. Iterate on product and keep making it better. Watch our efforts begin to compound! Compounding is fun.</t>
</p>
